      "heading": "Why 11 of 57",
      "body": "A crowdfund's release vote and its delivery record both live inside that crowdfund's own paid channel, readable only by people who backed it. These 11 are what is visible from a single supporter's account. Covering the whole catalogue would take someone who backed every crowdfund in the roles system, or a server admin. Everything in these two sections is therefore a sample, not the population — the catalogue below is complete, the depth is not."
    },
    "destinationNote": "`destination` is where a crowdfund's output landed, reconstructed 2026-08-30 from public channels, Nexus and the supporter armoury. It is NOT the same claim as `vote`: broader, weaker, and not always what the vote said, because some votes cover only part of a project. confidence: vote = read from the crowdfund's own channel; strong = the creator or a moderator said so; moderate = members only."
  },
